app.T3BlblNlYXJjaA.action.YWdncmVnYXRl.o.source:
The aggregations to compute. Each key is the aggregation name, value is the aggregation definition. Example:
```
{
  "avg_price": {"avg": {"field": "price"}},
  "by_category": {
    "terms": {"field": "category"},
    "aggs": {
      "category_avg": {"avg": {"field": "price"}}
    }
  }
}
```

